AFFIDAVIT

I, Mr. Hari Mohan Sharma, S/o Shri Banwari Lal Sharma, aged 48 years,
residing at 12, Ratanada, Jodhpur – 342 001,
Site Engineer, M/s. Jal Nirman Constructions Ltd.,
do hereby solemnly affirm and state as follows:

1. I am the Site Engineer for the Sukli Medium Irrigation Dam Project and am fully conversant
   with the facts stated herein.

2. I was present at the site continuously from 01.09.2019 onwards and have personal
   knowledge of all site activities and WRD's actions/inactions.

3. Regarding the geological surprise: I personally supervised the foundation excavation
   work in December 2019. The rock hardness encountered was significantly higher than
   anticipated based on WRD's geo-technical report.

4. I witnessed the WRD technical team's site visit on 15.01.2020. The team conducted
   on-site rock hardness tests and confirmed Type III rock (hard rock) instead of Type I
   (soft rock).

5. The additional drilling and blasting operations required:
   - Rock breakers (2 units) deployed for 8 months
   - Excavators with rock bucket (3 units) deployed for 8 months
   - Specialized explosives (ANFO) consumption increased by 300%
   - Blasting charges increased from ₹45,000/day to ₹1,25,000/day

6. Regarding the design revision: On 01.10.2020, the WRD Superintending Engineer (Design)
   verbally instructed us to revise the spillway design to increase capacity from 1200 cumecs
   to 1500 cumecs for safety enhancement.

7. I have recorded this instruction in my site diary dated 01.10.2020.
   The revised design drawings were received from WRD on 15.11.2020.

8. We executed the additional spillway work as per the revised design.
   However, WRD has not formally priced this in a Variation Order.

9. Regarding the cofferdam breach: I was present at the site on 12.06.2021 when the
   unprecedented rainfall occurred. The water level rose rapidly and the cofferdam was
   overtopped and breached within 2 hours.

10. The damage was severe:
    - Complete structural failure of cofferdam
    - Foundation works partially submerged
    - Excavation filled with silt and debris
    - 2 excavators and 1 crane damaged

11. All facts stated above are within my personal knowledge and are true to the best of my
    information and belief. No part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed.

Deponent: Hari Mohan Sharma
Date: 15.10.2022
Place: Jodhpur

Sworn before me:
Oath Commissioner / Notary Public